000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.          CUPDOVER.
000400 AUTHOR.              C HILLES.
000500 DATE-WRITTEN.        5/7/85.
000600 DATE-COMPILED.
000700*INSTALLATION.        GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER - AKRON.
000800*
000900*D REMARKS.  AKRON UPDATE UPDATE OVERAGE ITEMS SUBPROGRAM.
001000*D
001100*D   THIS SUBPROGRAM IS CALLED FROM "TAKRUPDT" - THE AKRON UPDATE
001200*D   PROGRAM.  THIS IS FOR TRANSACTION CODES "31 AND "32" FROM THE
001300*D   MAINFRAME, WHICH UPDATE OVERAGE ITEMS: FOR ANY PLANT THAT HAS
001400*D   OVERAGE, THE CORP CODES ARE DOWNLOADED TO ANY NON-OVERAGE
001500*D   PLANTS WITH THE SAME CORP CODE AND THE OVERAGE PLANT IS ADDED
001600*D   AS A REQUIREMENTS ORDER
001700*D
      *C   06/04/92 - DAVE PLUM            REQUEST #6217
      *C
      *C   REVISED PARAGRAPH 7400-UPDATE-ITEM TO UPDATE BOTH ITM-UM
      *C   AND ITM-PRICE-UM WHEN PROCESSING AN UPDATE TRANSACTION
      *C   RECEIVED FROM THE AKRON MAINFRAME (TC 31).  ALSO ATTEMPTED
      *C   TO CLARIFY WHETHER THIS PARAGRAPH IS BEING EXECUTED BECAUSE
      *C   AN "UPDATE" TRANSACTION HAS BEEN RECEIVED, OR A "DELETE"
      *C   TRANSACTION HAS BEEN RECEIVED (TC 32).
      *C
      *C   04/19/1993   DAVE PLUM     REQUEST #6338
      *C   COMMENTED OUT THE "DISPLAY" STATEMENTS WHICH REPORTED ON THE
      *C   VARIOUS ADDITIONS, DELETIONS, AND MODIFICATIONS PERFORMED BY
      *C   THIS PROGRAM.
      *C
      *C   09/12/96  JEFF BUNGO
      *C   EXPAND DATE FIELDS FOR YEAR 2000 COMPLIANCE.
      *C   INCLUDE CENTURY ON THE PO CREATE DATE.  ALSO,
      *C   SET THE PO AND ITEM EXPECT DATE TO 99991231.
      *C   CHANGE KEY FIELD OF DAILYSHIPREL TO DATECYMD
      *C   FROM DLYTCDATE TO INCLUDE CENTURY.
      *C
      *C   26FEB1997  DAVE PLUM
      *C   REVISED TO INITIALIZE THE NEW DPOITEM NUMERIC
      *C   FIELD FOR ASN QUANTITY TO ZERO.
      *C
      *C   10/27/1997   CA YODER
      *C   RE-COMPILED TO PICK UP USER-ID FIELD IN DSHIPREL.
      *C
      *C   02/04/2002   FRED HERRO
      *C   ADD CALL TO DELETE DPODATAITM.
      *C
      *C   02/11/2002   FRED HERRO
      *C   CHANGE PARAG. 7400-UPDATE-ITEM
      *C     DELETE DPODATAITM BEFORE CHECKING THE NEW UNIT OF MEASURE
      *C
001800 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
